#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# right_coset_representatives

#% text
# `right_coset_representatives(G, H)`: representatives r of the right cosets H r of H in G

#% section
# Details

#% item
# The first representative is the identity. The second argument must be a subgroup of the first.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
right_coset_representatives(symmetric_group(4), alternating_group(4))
#% output
#= [cycles([]), cycles([[1, 2]])]

#% cell
length(right_coset_representatives(mathieu_group(11), group_stabilizer(mathieu_group(11), 1)))
#% output
#= 11

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `left_coset_representatives`, `subgroup_index`
